00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.640
This is the story of scoon.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:05.980
Swiss government TV.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.820
Planet Earth is in a state of emergency.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.260
Cities all over the world are sinking into the ocean.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:12.940
Even as I speak, my own city is sinking.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.700
The water is already up to my knees.

00:05:14.940 --> 00:05:17.280
I'm sacrificing myself for this broadcast.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:25.220
Earth Defense Army has announced that the Neptunians, an underwater race of alien beings, have invaded Earth and are melting the polar ice caps.

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:28.980
They are living under the sea and using humans for food.

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:33.500
Six months ago at the bank tune, the rulers of the planet recognized that their world was dying.

00:05:33.740 --> 00:05:36.680
It was being turned into desert by falling meteorites.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:41.020
Man ham livestock, which was the Neptunians used for food, was being destroyed.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:45.720
To escape this terrible fate, the Neptunians were forced to move their entire civilization into the sea.

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:49.300
They knew they'd be temporarily safe in the sea, but would eventually die of starvation.

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:55.100
The Neptunian government therefore decided that the only way to save their people was to invade Earth, where there was plenty of man ham.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:06:05.160
They constructed special spaceships with giant water tanks for them to live in during the trip, but only with the highest government officials and the beautiful Miss Neptune were able to escape before the planet was totally annihilated.

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:12.780
About the time the Neptunians landed on Earth, a pirate named Narkeen was mining gold under the oceans of the world using his submarine, Skun.

00:06:12.780 --> 00:06:15.780
He was a dastardly pirate and committed all kinds of crimes.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:19.940
When his Skun was full of gold, he would go into port and trade his gold for drog.

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:23.580
