00:43:15.000 --> 00:43:16.940
Yeah. But it goes through like, have you seen the movie?

00:43:17.160 --> 00:43:19.080
Oh, man. It's like really trippy.

00:43:19.700 --> 00:43:22.760
All the man ham people that fall out of the.

00:43:22.840 --> 00:43:23.820
They're like the blue meanies.

00:43:24.060 --> 00:43:29.100
No, no. They are just, you know, like slightly changed sprites to make them look more like the Beatles.

00:43:29.400 --> 00:43:31.640
Yeah. And then the blue meanies would be all the enemies.

00:43:31.640 --> 00:43:34.800
How could you change those little tiny little stick-finger sprites to look like the Beatles?

00:43:34.800 --> 00:43:36.300
You make them a little bit bigger.

00:43:36.800 --> 00:43:38.480
And you give them British accents.

00:43:39.000 --> 00:43:39.900
Yeah. It's amazing.

00:43:40.240 --> 00:43:43.520
I'm pretty sure Broderbund's daughter drew those sprites.

00:43:44.680 --> 00:43:45.740
Broderbund's just a guy.

00:43:46.180 --> 00:43:47.820
Broderbund's daughter sounds like a band.

00:43:48.500 --> 00:43:52.980
Yeah. Broderbund's daughter is cool, but I was saying Broderbund in the same sense that they say Neptunians.

00:43:53.380 --> 00:43:56.940
Right. You know, it's just the collective conscience of that company.

00:43:56.940 --> 00:43:57.840
We are Broderbund.

00:43:57.940 --> 00:43:59.740
All right, guys. That's it for the post-show, too.

00:43:59.740 --> 00:44:03.380
I wanted to ask Sam more really hard questions.

00:44:03.700 --> 00:44:06.140
Yeah, grill them at other of the central games.

00:44:06.140 --> 00:44:07.560
Just like really, really hard.

00:44:07.760 --> 00:44:13.260
Like in three sentences or less, describe the best way to improve the color palette of this game.

00:44:13.420 --> 00:44:14.760
Please restate the question.

00:44:15.080 --> 00:44:21.080
More muted colors. Sam, you have 20 minutes to open Unity and recreate Spoon in its entirety.

00:44:21.500 --> 00:44:26.300
Well, he thought we were asking him to create a music track on the spot.

00:44:27.380 --> 00:44:29.640
I can't believe he thought I was asking him to do that.

00:44:30.600 --> 00:44:31.520
Oh, my gosh.

00:44:31.700 --> 00:44:32.960
All right, guys. Let's get out of here.

00:44:33.400 --> 00:44:35.120
All right. I'm pressing stop.

00:44:35.240 --> 00:44:36.540
And by get out of here, I mean just hit the stop.

00:44:36.860 --> 00:44:38.620
I'm pressing stop right now. All right, everybody. I'm pressing stop. up.
